    {
      "source": "<span class=\"deprecated-label\">Deprecated, for removal: This API element is subject to removal in a future version.</span>",
      "translation": "<code class=\"deprecated-label\">已弃用，即将移除：此 API 元素将在未来版本中被移除。</code>",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Jackson2MappingAwareSortTranslator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\"><code>Jackson2MappingAwareSortTranslator</code></a> for the given <code>ObjectMapper</code>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/support/Repositories.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>Repositories</code></a>,\n<a href=\"../support/DomainClassResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>DomainClassResolver</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/PersistentEntities.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>PersistentEntities</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <code>ObjectMapper</code>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/repository/support/Repositories.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>Repositories</code></a>、\n<a href=\"../support/DomainClassResolver.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.support\"><code>DomainClassResolver</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/PersistentEntities.html\" title=\"类或接口在 org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>PersistentEntities</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"Jackson2MappingAwareSortTranslator.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json 中的类\"><code>Jackson2MappingAwareSortTranslator</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Translates Jackson field names within a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> property names.",
      "translation": "将 Jackson 字段名称转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 中的 Jackson 字段名称，并将其映射到 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 属性名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Translator for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> arguments that is aware of Jackson-Mapping on domain classes. Jackson field names are\ntranslated to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> names. Domain class is looked up by resolving request URLs to mapped\nrepositories. <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> translation is skipped if a domain class cannot be resolved.",
      "translation": "支持对领域类进行 Jackson 映射的 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>` 参数。Jackson 字段名会被转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 名称。领域类通过解析请求 URL 到映射的存储库来查找。如果无法解析出领域类，则跳过 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>` 的转换。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Translates <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> orders from Jackson-mapped field names to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> names.",
      "translation": "将 Jackson 映射的字段名称转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 名称的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 排序。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "since 5.0, in favor of <a href=\"JacksonMappingAwareSortTranslator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\"><code>JacksonMappingAwareSortTranslator</code></a>",
      "translation": "自 5.0 版本起，改用<a href=\"JacksonMappingAwareSortTranslator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\"><code>JacksonMappingAwareSortTranslator</code></a>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"SortTranslator.html#translateSort(org.springframework.data.domain.Sort,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest)\">translateSort</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"SortTranslator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json\">SortTranslator</a></code>",
      "translation": "接口 <code><a href=\"SortTranslator.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc.json 中的接口\">SortTranslator</a></code> 中的方法 <code><a href=\"SortTranslator.html#translateSort(org.springframework.data.domain.Sort,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest)\">translateSort</a></code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> containing translated property names or null the resulting <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> contains\n        no properties.",
      "translation": "包含已翻译属性名称或为 null 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a>，其生成的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 将不包含任何属性。",
